bmbr_full=⊢ ∀(k :α) (v :β) (l :(α, β) balanced_map) (r :(α, β) balanced_map) (cmp :α -> α -> ordering). good_cmp cmp ∧ invariant cmp l ∧ invariant cmp r ⇒ balanceR k v l r = balR k v l r
